<title>USA: Coeur d'Alene does not declare dividend.</title>
<headline>Coeur d'Alene does not declare dividend.</headline>
<dateline>COEUR D'ALENE, Idaho 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coeur d'Alene Mines Corp said on Wednesday its board of directors elected not to declare a dividend on its common stock at this time.</p>
<p>The precious metals company was not immediately available to comment futher.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
